msgid "The ninth-period roll has written your name."
msgstr "第九時限の点呼簿があなたの名を書いた。"

#. words.title.no
#: src/js/mytu.js:412
msgctxt "text:words.title.no"
msgid "A row on the timetable's reverse does not belong to this term."
msgstr "時間割の裏に今学期ではない一行がある。"

#. words.body.yes
#: src/js/mytu.js:412
msgctxt "text:words.body.yes"
msgid ""
"Six ordinary administrative seals overlap on the reverse of one sheet. The "
"system cannot find a room; the north stair has begun roll call."
msgstr "六つの通常学務印が同じ紙の裏で重なった。システムは教室を見つけられないが、北階段は点呼を始めている。"

#. words.body.no
#: src/js/mytu.js:412
msgctxt "text:words.body.no"
msgid "{value0} seals currently show through; Academic Affairs still crosses out row nine."
msgstr "現在{value0}個の印が透け、第九行はまだ学務に消されている。"

#. words.action.yes
#: src/js/mytu.js:412
msgctxt "text:words.action.yes"
